      "id": "CORE-CFG-TPL-MISSING-01",
      "title": "A reference to a missing template is reported precisely, but sfc-main exits 0 (known defect)",
      "tier": "core",
      "priority": "P0",
      "intent": "Merged with CORE-CFG-TEMPLATES-NEG-01. TemplateResolver raises 'Template \"Nope\" does not exist, available templates are \"A\"' (TemplateResolver.kt:65-70). The exception is thrown while ServiceMain builds its logger from the configuration (ServiceMain.kt:103 -> Logger.kt:687, which constructs a ConfigReader), outside createAndRunServiceInstance, so it reaches the generic catch at ServiceMain.kt:120-121 instead of the exit(1) path (:171-173): run() returns and the JVM exits 0. A supervisor sees a clean exit. The gate accepts records or the exit.",
      "pins": [
        "core/sfc-core/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/config/TemplateResolver.kt:65",
        "core/sfc-core/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/service/ServiceMain.kt:103",
        "core/sfc-core/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/service/ServiceMain.kt:120",
        "core/sfc-core/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/service/ServiceMain.kt:171",
        "core/sfc-core/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/log/Logger.kt:687"
      ],
      "gate": {
        "sink": "main",
        "records": 3,
        "orExit": true
      },
      "timeoutSeconds": 40,
      "assert": [
        {
          "kind": "recordCount",
          "equals": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "logContains",
          "text": "Error running service"
        },
        {
          "kind": "logContains",
          "text": "Template \"Nope\" does not exist, available templates are \"A\""
        }
      ],
      "knownDefect": {
        "ref": "core/sfc-core/src/main/kotlin/com/amazonaws/sfc/service/ServiceMain.kt:120",
        "summary": "Template errors (and any BaseConfiguration parse error) are thrown from createLogger(configuration) at ServiceMain.kt:103, outside the instance-creation error handling, and swallowed at :120-121, so sfc-main exits 0 on an invalid configuration. Correct: exit 1, like validation errors.",
        "assertCurrent": [
          {
            "kind": "exitCode",
            "equals": 0
          }
        ],
        "assertCorrect": [
          {
            "kind": "exitCode",
            "equals": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      "config": {
